{"unit_id":"M2-Z__dsh-question-locator#card-zh","repo":"M2-Z/dsh-question-locator","commit":"971f2244ea79e51454eef0c49809cdcc5de03ce9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-question-locator（DSH Web 插件，网页客户端）：在当前会话中查看自己提出的问题并快速回到原消息。它通过 DSH 的 shell.overlay 槽位添加侧边浮层，读取会话快照并列出 user 与 steering 消息；选择条目后滚动到对应聊天行并短暂高亮。适合需要在长会话里反复查找先前提问的用户。运行不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务，需在 DSH Web GUI 中使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:69-102","src/client/index.ts:258-266"]}
{"unit_id":"M2-Z__dsh-question-locator#card-en","repo":"M2-Z/dsh-question-locator","commit":"971f2244ea79e51454eef0c49809cdcc5de03ce9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-question-locator is a DSH Web plugin for finding earlier questions. It adds a floating panel to shell.overlay, lists user and steering messages from the current session, then scrolls to and highlights a selected message. Useful in long chats; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:69-102","src/client/index.ts:258-266"]}
