{"unit_id":"M2-Z__dsh-question-locator#feature-1","repo":"M2-Z/dsh-question-locator","commit":"971f2244ea79e51454eef0c49809cdcc5de03ce9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-question-locator 的功能「会话问题列表」：从当前会话快照收集 user 与 steering 消息中的文本，作为可点击条目展示在“我的问题”面板中。点击侧边的“问”按钮打开面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:111-119","src/client/index.ts:198-245"]}
